+## Test Case 1: Create booking successfully
+
+Endpoint:
+
+POST /api/bookings
+
+Request body:
+
+{
+  "customerId": 1,
+  "specialistId": 1,
+  "slotId": 1,
+  "topic": "Software Consultation",
+  "notes": "Need help with architecture"
+}
+
+Expected result:
+- Booking is created successfully.
+- Response contains bookingId, customerId, specialistId, slotId, topic, notes, status, price, createdAt, updatedAt.
+- Status is PENDING.
+- Price is copied from specialist fee.
+
+Actual result:
+- **PASSED** - Booking created successfully.
+- Response: `{"success":true,"message":"Booking created successfully","data":{"bookingId":1,"customerId":1,"customerName":"customer1","specialistId":1,"specialistName":"specialist1","slotId":1,"slotDateTime":"2026-04-30T09:00:00","topic":"Software Consultation","notes":"Need help with architecture","status":"PENDING","price":150.00,"createdAt":"...","updatedAt":null}}`
+- Price is correctly copied from specialist fee (150.00).
+
+Screenshot:
+- docs/screenshots/booking-create-success.png
