+## Notes for Group Report
+
+The booking core module enables the creation of consultation bookings within the booking system. When a customer books a consultation, the system performs comprehensive validations to ensure data integrity.
+
+**All 10 test cases passed successfully**, validating:
+
+1. **Booking Creation** - Successfully creates a booking with all required fields.
+
+2. **Status Assignment** - New bookings are automatically assigned PENDING status.
+
+3. **Price Calculation** - Booking price is correctly copied from specialist's fee.
+
+4. **Slot Status Update** - After booking creation, the slot status automatically changes from AVAILABLE to BOOKED.
+
+5. **Entity Validation**:
+   - Customer must exist
+   - Specialist must exist
+   - Slot must exist
+
+6. **Business Rule Validation**:
+   - Slot must belong to the selected specialist
+   - Slot must be AVAILABLE
+   - Same slot cannot be booked twice
+
+7. **Response Format** - All responses use a standard ApiResponse format with success boolean, message, and data fields. Password information is never exposed in any response.
+
+The module follows a clean architecture pattern with thin controllers and business logic centralized in the BookingService. Exception handling is managed through the GlobalExceptionHandler for consistent error responses.
+
+Additional endpoints available:
+- PUT /api/bookings/{bookingId}/confirm - Confirm a booking
+- PUT /api/bookings/{bookingId}/cancel - Cancel a booking
+- PUT /api/bookings/{bookingId}/complete - Complete a booking
+- GET /api/bookings - Get all bookings
+- GET /api/bookings/customer/{customerId} - Get bookings by customer
+- GET /api/bookings/specialist/{specialistId} - Get bookings by specialist
